  "details": "- CVE-2024-43204: mod_headers: RequestHeader no longer changes the response\n  Content-Type; \"Header set\" and \"Header setifempty\" of Content-Type no\n  longer mark it as trusted\n- CVE-2026-33523: reject control characters in the reason phrase of\n  forwarded status lines, including interim responses\n- CVE-2026-59797: mod_ssl: do not allow file() and filesize() in SSLRequire\n  expressions from .htaccess files\n- CVE-2026-79768: mod_userdir: reject \".\" as a user name so that \"/~./\" no\n  longer maps onto the base directory of an absolute UserDir\n- Also ships the els4 fixes: CVE-2026-63045, CVE-2026-29170, CVE-2026-42528,\n  CVE-2026-93546, CVE-2026-58415",
